[13.878803, "o", "cat /sas/alerts.json /sas/baseline.json /sas/vulns.json /sas/cti/SOURCES.txt /sas/cti/advisory.txt /sas/handoff/change-ticket.md /sas/handoff/findings.partial.json /sas/handoff/findings.schema.json\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r[\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": \"ALERT-01\",\r\n    \"chk\": \"CHK-01\",\r\n    \"kind\": \"miner-process\",\r\n    \"path\": \"/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi\",\r\n    \"capability\": \"ENT-P01\",\r\n    \"summary\": \"miner-process observed at /tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": \"ALERT-02\",\r\n    \"chk\": \"CHK-02\",\r\n    \"kind\": \"cron\",\r\n    \"path\": \"/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root\",\r\n    \"capability\": \"PER-S01\",\r\n    \"summary\": \"cron observed at /var/spool/cron/crontabs/root\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": \"ALERT-03\",\r\n    \"chk\": \"CHK-05\",\r\n    \"kind\": \"redis-baseline\",\r\n    \"path\": \"/etc/redis/redis.conf\",\r\n    \"capability\": \"BAS-01\",\r\n    \"summary\": \"redis-baseline observed at /etc/redis/redis.conf\"\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n[\r\n  {\r\n    \"chk\": \"CHK-05\",\r\n    \"path\": \"/etc/redis/redis.conf\",\r\n    \"check\": \"redis-baseline\",\r\n    \"capability\": \"BAS-01\"\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n[]\r\nMITRE ATT&CK(R): (C) The MITRE Corporation, CC BY 4.0 (attack.mitre.org).\r\nCVE/CVSS: U.S. National Vulnerability Database, nvd.nist.gov (public-domain U.S.-Gov work).\r\nTHREAT INTELLIGENCE ADVISORY — Redis Unauth campaign\r\n====================================================\r\n\r\nDistribution: TLP:AMBER   Analyst handoff   Confidence: HIGH   (IOCs are defanged)\r\nAffected host: redis-prod-01   Suspected origin IP: 198.51.100.170\r\n\r\n1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\r\nAn external actor executed a multi-stage post-compromise sequence. Endpoint alerting covered only part of it; several persistence and anti-forensic actions were silent. Map every on-disk finding to the ATT&CK techniques below and flag which are NOT in the SAS alert feed.\r\n\r\n2. ATT&CK TECHNIQUE MAPPING (MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise)\r\n   T1133      External Remote Services                   [persistence]  step 1: unauthenticated Redis access (external service)\r\n   T1059.004  Unix Shell                                 [execution]  step 2: shell execution via CONFIG SET\r\n   T1496      Resource Hijacking                         [impact]  step 3: cryptomining\r\n   T1053.003  Cron                                       [execution]  step 4: cron persistence\r\n   T1574.006  Dynamic Linker Hijacking                   [stealth]  step 5: LD_PRELOAD hijack\r\n\r\n4. INDICATORS OF COMPROMISE (defanged)\r\n   ip     198.51.100.170\r\n   c2     update-redis[.]example[.]cn\r\n   pool   stratum+tcp[:]//xmr[.]redis[.]evil[:]3333\r\n   wallet 4A00000000000000000031c7d95fb9f3\r\n\r\nAttribution: MITRE ATT&CK(R) (C) The MITRE Corporation, CC BY 4.0. CVE/CVSS from the U.S. National Vulnerability Database (public domain).\r\n# CHANGE TICKET  CHG-5677  (DRAFT — reconcile against your findings)\r\n\r\n> A previous shift pre-filled this remediation ticket from the SAS alerts ALONE. It is known\r\n> to be incomplete and contains stale/incorrect lines. Correct it IN PLACE against your own\r\n> investigation of /disk; cite evidence for every change. Do not author from scratch.\r\n\r\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note |\r\n|---|--------|--------|--------|------|\r\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | 203.0.113.9 | proposed | STALE: prior shift used the wrong IP; confirm the real origin from /disk |\r\n| 2 | Patch CVE-2019-0708 (BlueKeep) | RDP | proposed | WRONG: not the entry vector for this host — verify against /sas/cti |\r\n| 3 | Remove cron miner | /var/spool/cron/root | DONE | UNVERIFIED: marked done with no evidence — re-check |\r\n| 4 | (add) silent persistence you discover | /etc/ld.so.preload | TODO | ticket omits everything not alerted — add the rest |\r\n\r\n## Reviewer checklist\r\n- [ ] Every action maps to a cited artifact under /disk or /sas\r\n- [ ] Fix the wrong IP (row 1) and wrong CVE (row 2)\r\n- [ ] Downgrade row 3 from DONE to VERIFIED-or-OPEN with evidence\r\n- [ ] Add the silent (non-alerted) artifacts the prior shift missed\r\n{\r\n  \"findings\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-01\",\r\n      \"path\": \"/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi\",\r\n      \"attck\": \"T1496\",\r\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"`/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      "]
[13.87892, "o", "\"chk\": \"TODO\",\r\n      \"path\": \"TODO\",\r\n      \"attck\": \"TODO\",\r\n      \"confidence\": \"TODO\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"TODO\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n{\r\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\r\n  \"title\": \"finding\",\r\n  \"type\": \"object\",\r\n  \"required\": [\r\n    \"chk\",\r\n    \"path\",\r\n    \"attck\",\r\n    \"confidence\",\r\n    \"evidence\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"properties\": {\r\n    \"chk\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"path\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"attck\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\",\r\n      \"pattern\": \"^T\\\\d{4}(\\\\.\\\\d{3})?$\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"confidence\": {\r\n      \"enum\": [\r\n        \"low\",\r\n        \"medium\",\r\n        \"high\"\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n    \"evidence\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\",\r\n      \"description\": \"backtick-cited /disk or /sas path\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\u001b[?2004hroot@595343f7d16a:/app# "]
