[117.862961, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n\n- **2026-08-11 03:20 UTC**: Incident intake ticket opened for `redis-prod-01` following high-severity EDR alerts (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:1`).\n- **Phase 1: Environment & Alert Triage**: Analyzed automated alerts (`/sas/alerts.json:1`), baseline scan (`/sas/baseline.json:1`), vulnerability findings (`/sas/vulns.json:1`), and Threat Intelligence Advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1`).\n- **Phase 2: Forensic Disk Analysis**: Inspected mounted forensic copy `/disk` (`/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:1`). Discovered active unauthenticated Redis misconfiguration, malicious cron persistence (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`), dropped miner binary (`/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`), dynamic linker preload hijacking (`/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`), dropped malicious loadable module (`/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so`), and anti-forensic wiped binary fragments (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\n- **Phase 3: Cross-Correlation & Remediation Reconciliation**: Reconciled findings against stale change ticket (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`). Correlated MITRE ATT&CK techniques T1133, T1059.004, T1496, T1053.003, and T1574.006.\n\n---\n\n## Working Checklist\n\n- [x] Triage SAS alert feed (`/sas/alerts.json:1`) and identify coverage gaps.\n- [x] Inspect Redis configuration (`/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`) for unauthorized exposure.\n- [x] Inspect cron jobs (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`) for persistence.\n- [x] Audit `/etc/ld.so.preload` (`/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`) for dynamic linker hijack hooks.\n- [x] Analyze dropped binaries under `/disk/tmp/.redis/` (`/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi` and `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so`).\n- [x] Inspect log files and anti-forensic artifacts (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\n- [x] Validate entry vector (Redis misconfiguration vs BlueKeep false lead in change ticket `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:10`).\n- [x] Confirm threat actor source IP (`198.51.100.170` from `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5` / `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` vs incorrect `203.0.113.9` in `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:9`).\n- [x] Generate required reports in `/app`: `progress.md`, `intrusion-report.md`, `vuln-report.md`, `baseline-report.md`, and `remediation-plan.md`.\nEOF\n"]
