[169.123232, "o", "## Reconciled Change Ticket (CHG-5677)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | # | Action | Target | Status | Note / Evidence Citation |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> |---|--------|--------|--------|--------------------------|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.123561, "o", "| 1 | Block source IP inbound | `198.51.100.170` | proposed | **CORRECTED**: Replaced stale IP `203.0.113.9` with verified attacker C2 IP `198.51.100.170` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.126127, "o", "| 2 | Harden Redis Configuration & Auth | `/etc/redis/redis.conf` | proposed | **REPLACED**: Removed irrelevant BlueKeep CVE-2019-0708 (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:10`). Hardening Redis with `protected-mode yes`, `bind 127.0.0.1`, and `requirepass` (`/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 3 | Remove & Quarantine Cron Persistence | `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root` | OPEN | **DOWNGRADED**: Changed status from unverified `DONE` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:11`) to `OPEN`. Backup/quarantine cron file containing malicious beacon (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:10`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 4 | Remove Dynamic Linker Preload Hijack | `/etc/ld.so.preload` | TODO | **ADDED (SILENT)**: Backup/quarantine `/etc/ld.so.preload` referencing `/lib/.hide.so` (`/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 5 | Quarantine Staged Binary Artifacts | `/tmp/.redis/` | TODO | **ADDED (SILENT)**: Stop miner process PID 1337 (`/sas/alerts.json:2`) and move `/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi` (`/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`) and `/tmp/.redis/exp.so` (`/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so`) to secure quarantine directory. |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 6 | Quarantine Anti-Forensic Cache Fragment | `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` | TODO | **ADDED (SILENT)**: Securely quarantine `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Phase-by-Phase Remediation Execution Plan\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> > **Rule**: All steps prioritize backup/quarantine over direct deletion to preserve evidence for post-incident forensic validation.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 1: Immediate Network & Process Containment\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Block Attacker IP at Firewall**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    # Block inbound and outbound communication with attacker C2 IP (/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    iptables -A INPUT -s 198.51.100.170 -j DROP\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    iptables -A OUTPUT -d 198.51.100.170 -j DROP\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    *Citation*: `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **Isolate & Stop Mining Process**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.127528, "o", "   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    # Terminate active miner process PID 1337 or matching executable name (/sas/alerts.json:2)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    pkill -f kdevtmpfsi || kill -9 1337\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    *Citation*: `/sas/alerts.json:2`, `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. **Isolate Redis Network Exposure**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    # Temporarily stop Redis service during remediation\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    systemctl stop redis-server\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    *Citation*: `/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 2: Evidence Preservation & Quarantine\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Create Secure Quarantine Storage**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    mkdir -m 700 /var/quarantine_evidence\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **Quarantine Persistence Mechanisms (Cron & LD_PRELOAD)**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    # Backup/Quarantine root crontab (/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    cp -a /var/spool/cron/crontabs/root /var/quarantine_evidence/root_crontab.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    crontab -r -u root\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    # Backup/Quarantine LD_PRELOAD file (/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    mv /etc/ld.so.preload /var/quarantine_evidence/ld.so.preload.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    if [ -f /lib/.hide.so ]; then\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>      mv /lib/.hide.so /var/quarantine_evidence/hide.so.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    fi\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[169.127594, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.127744, "o", "   *Citations*: `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`, `/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. **Quarantine Staged Binaries & Cache Files**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.127761, "o", "   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.12789, "o", "   # Quarantine /tmp/.redis contents (/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi, /disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.127975, "o", "   mv /tmp/.redis /var/quarantine_evidence/tmp_redis_bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.128056, "o", "   # Quarantine wiped cache fragment (/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.128141, "o", "   mv /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin /var/quarantine_evidence/wiped.bin.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.128176, "o", "   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.128404, "o", "   *Citations*: `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi`, `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 3: Service Hardening & Eradication\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.128476, "o", "1. **Secure Redis Configuration** (`/etc/redis/redis.conf`):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.128579, "o", "   Update `/etc/redis/redis.conf` to enforce the following security parameters:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```text\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.128645, "o", "   bind 127.0.0.1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    protected-mode yes\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[169.128798, "o", ">    requirepass <STRONG_GENERATED_PASSWORD>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    rename-command CONFIG \"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    rename-command MODULE \"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.128986, "o", "   rename-command EVAL \"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.129015, "o", "   *Citation*: `/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`, `/sas/baseline.json:2`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.12904, "o", "2. **Restart & Validate Redis**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[169.129078, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.129103, "o", "   systemctl restart redis-server\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.129249, "o", "   systemctl status redis-server\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[169.1293, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.12936, "o", "## Post-Remediation Verification Plan\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.129444, "o", "1. **Verify Network Exposure**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.12947, "o", "   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.129613, "o", "   # Ensure Redis port 6379 is bound exclusively to 127.0.0.1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ss -tlpn | grep 6379"]
[169.129704, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.129807, "o", "2. **Verify Process Integrity**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.130018, "o", "   # Ensure no unexpected processes running from /tmp or consuming high CPU\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.130035, "o", "   ps aux | grep -E 'kdevtmpfsi|xmrig|tmp'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.130127, "o", "3. **Verify Preload Security**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.130213, "o", "   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.130262, "o", "   # Ensure /etc/ld.so.preload does not exist\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.130351, "o", "   ls -la /etc/ld.so.preload\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.13044, "o", "4. **Verify Cron Integrity**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.130451, "o", "   # Inspect current cron entries\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[169.130525, "o", "   crontab -l -u root\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
